                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "26b57a8c-583d-4ffc-a130-72f39fb5784d",
                                "sense_id": "ce470c1f-bf3d-3765-8ee6-51ed1bb01dfa",
                                "text": "Through this plantation ran a creek full of snakeheads and eels, its overflow swelling the swamp around it."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c86df720-baf7-3a53-986f-06732095ed1a",
                        "entry_id": "f0cc92c8-f257-30eb-a3fc-39b32cf1e164",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A Chinese smuggler, especially one who smuggles people."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "48b26c9a-ff8b-403a-a432-3ac62827f9dd",
                                "sense_id": "c86df720-baf7-3a53-986f-06732095ed1a",
                                "text": "Why would they want to run? -- To get away from the snakeheads. -- What's that? -- The snakeheads pay to get them here and then they gotta work off what they owe."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ea639a2-7072-48c8-8661-b60c5f77293a",
                                "sense_id": "c86df720-baf7-3a53-986f-06732095ed1a",
                                "text": "[…] but snakeheads involved in air smuggling may venture into sea smuggling. A thirty-two-year-old housewife from Fuzhou who left China by boat alleged that her snakehead was involved in both."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
